IMPORT prelude

-- An event whose time stamp is not a whole number, inside an obligation whose
-- window reaches it. `l4 explore` never reads the stamp. The note on it names
-- a --grid step that divides it (0.2 for 3.8); under that step the explorer
-- tries an act at 3.8, and under a step that does not divide it (0.5) it does
-- not, and says nothing about the stamp.

DECLARE Person IS ONE OF P
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF a

GIVETH A DEONTIC Person Action
one MEANS PARTY P MUST a WITHIN 5 HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH BY P

#TRACE one AT 0 WITH
  PARTY P DOES a AT 3.8
